	TAD TEMP0
	SMA CLA		/WE MUST FIND OUT WHICH IS LEFT
	JMP KNOB1	/KNOB 0 IS ON THE RIGHT
	TAD TEMP01	/KNOB 1 IS ON RIGHT
	TAD M27
	JMS DELTA	/GET INCREMENT TO MOVE BOUNDARY
	DCA I ENDX
	TAD TEMP0
