	SMA SZA		/TOO LARGE STILL?
	CLA CLL		/YES. SET TO MAX.
OVFLO,	TAD K1751	/THIS IS ORIGINAL VALUE OR MAX.
	DCA ARITH2	/SAVE IT HERE
	JMP I SCLDAT	/GO BACK
