YTEMP,	0
UP,	CIA
	DCA LENGTH

YMOVE,	JMS I DELAYX	/MAYBE PLOTTING
	TAD YTEMP	/CURRENT Y POSITION
	TAD YINC	/ADD INCREMENT
	DIXY
	DILY
	DCA YTEMP	/SAVE IT FOR NEXT TIME
