	JMP YMOVE	/NO DO MORE
	JMP I YDISP	/ALL DONE WITH VECTOR
/XDIS: A SUBROUTINE TO DRAW AN X VECTOR FROM THE CURRENT
/POSITION WHICH IS HELD IN XTEMP TO AN ENDING POSITION WHOSE COORDINATE
/IS HELD IN LENGTH.
XDISP,	0
	CMA CLA		/AC=-1
	DCA XINC	/SET INITIALLY TO -1
	TAD XTEMP	/CURRENT POSITION
