/OCTIZE: SUBROUTINE TO CONVERT TTYBUFF INTO OCTAL AND LEAVE
/THE RESULT IN THE AC. LOCATION UNIT HOLDS THE NUMBER OF
/DECIMAL PLACES IN THE ARGUMENT.
OCTIZ,	0
	TAD I UNITX	/GET RADIX
